The app is written in `src/` and passes `./check` and the visible `./test` run (26/26). I used 2 of the 15 runs. The only console error is a 404 in one test, which I believe is the browser requesting a favicon, since the app loads no resources, but I did not confirm it. I built the app with my own state reducer rather than React Query, so the optimistic moves, edits and reverts stay tied to each card and item. I also disabled Add and move-into buttons while the target column is still loading or has failed, which the brief doesn't spell out.